POST {{host}}/getEventLogs
Accept: application/json

{
    "filters": { "logType": "15" },
    "pagination": { "size": 5 }
}

### Get both new oracle event types in one call

POST {{host}}/getEventLogs
Accept: application/json

{
    "filters": { "logType": "14,15" },
    "pagination": { "size": 10 }
}

